wash (0.9.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Hermetic native packaging: deb/rpm/apk built from a source-only tarball
    inside sanitized per-distro Docker images, across amd64/arm64/riscv64.
  * Optional wash-display compositor package (amd64/arm64) with vendored wlroots.
  * Multi-user wash-login, the background service tier (notify/bulk/priv),
    networking (wash-net/netd), storage (wash-disks), and the audio/media apps.
  * Build/test/packaging unified behind a goal-oriented `make` interface.

 -- sirmick <sirmick@gmail.com>  Sat, 13 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000

